{"text": "Modern street art. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Comes in many different forms. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And it makes cities colorful and lively. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Today we are going to see some well known street artworks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In London. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The place that we are going to visit. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Is Shoreditch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Poor workers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Used to live in this area. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But now it is one of the hippest areas. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In London. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We can find so many great pieces of street art here. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do you see the painting over there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is by the artist STIK. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He is famous for using only lines and dots. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In his paintings of human bodies. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> According to STIK. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The three figures. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Represent the past, present, and future of Shoreditch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Which figure represents which. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Well look closely at the eyes of the three figures. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They are just dots. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But they will give you a clue.", "alignment": {"characters": ["M", "o", "d", "e", "r", "n", " ", "s", "t", "r", "e", "e", "t", " ", "a", "r", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "C", "o", "m", "e", "s", " ", "i", "n", " ", "m", "a", "n", "y", " ", "d", "i", "f", "f", "e", "r", "e", "n", "t", " ", "f", "o", "r", "m", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "n", "d", " ", "i", "t", " ", "m", "a", "k", "e", "s", " ", "c", "i", "t", "i", "e", "s", " ", "c", "o", "l", "o", "r", "f", "u", "l", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "l", "y", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "